OL,3,GNEWSAEx-world champ Bruno delivers
OL,4,Afootballs to parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer boxing world champion Frank
OL,7,FBruno has distributed free footballs to
OL,8,Flocal parks in support of a scheme
OL,9,Fencouraging children to get active.
OL,11,FThe 64-year-old delivered 10 footballs
OL,12,Fto Southchurch Park in Southend-on-Sea
OL,13,Fand the nearby village of Hockley in
OL,14,FEssex.
OL,16,FRitchie Beckett, the director of
OL,17,Fnon-profit initiative Found Football,
OL,18,Fis pledging to drop more of them in the
OL,19,Fcounty's parks before the end of the
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
